<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Hero (the commander) and troop characters of Commander Battle's Aserai troop classes (cb_mpclassdivisions_aserai.xml),
  merged into Native's mpcharacters.xml (MPCharacters, MultiplayerGame only). All new ids: the stock characters stay
  untouched. Same rules as cb_mpcharacters_vlandia.xml:
  - default_group sets the class group, hence the role (Infantry, Ranged, Cavalry, HorseArcher).
  - Bots draw every equipment slot from a random roster of their character (Equipment.GetRandomEquipmentElements with a
    seed rolls again per slot), so each slot holds the same kind of item in every roster: the rosters vary the looks,
    never the loadout. Weapons are the same in every roster; the weapon setups (perks) swap them.
  - Slots: Item0 main weapon, Item1 shield (or arrows), Item2 sidearm, Item3 free (the horse archers' targe).
  - Gear tiers: light = levy (padded robes, a steel desert helmet, a decent oval shield, a proper weapon and a
    sidearm); medium = footmen (mail robes, a helmet with mail); heavy = mamelukes (lamellar and plated mail, closed or
    noble helmets, plate gauntlets and the best Aserai weapons). A step lighter than Vlandia and Sturgia at each weight.
  - Cavalry carry the adarga (the mounted skirmisher setup swaps in a round shield); archers carry a mace sidearm; the
    horse archers carry a small bound round shield as their targe (mpitems has no Aserai targe).
  - Throwing skill is kept up on infantry and cavalry for the jereed setups.
  - Items only from Native's mpitems.xml.
-->
